  "NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run release:check",project,2400,authoritative coverage and release gate
close_reason: Verified cache refresh and compare-and-swap shipped in this branch with installed-CLI strace evidence and exact 100 percent coverage.
